  "338": "Q: I have updated the workbook file for column ‘interface’ name to ‘device_name’ for ‘function_parameter’ sheet. Please hlep me to make the the ‘Import’, ‘Reset & import’, and ‘Export workbook’ buttons on the ‘Import’ page to implement this changes.",
